{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your gears in motion for a captivating monochromatic adventure where you play as Lelu, a small but determined clockwork toy who has gained consciousness and found a taste for freedom! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate your way through the toy factory, a labyrinthian tower filled with puzzles and traps set by the factory\u2019s eccentric guardian. Use your wits and agility to overcome challenges, from conveyor belts and electrifying circuits to sentient toys and towering titans.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you delve deeper into the world, uncover hidden abilities to aid you in your quest, alongside a variety of secrets and other toys sharing your desire for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you find your way to the elusive exit, or will you just be another toy on the shelf?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fight enemies and bosses with your trusty tools!   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131340/extras/lelu_gif2.gif?t=1742243893\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a variety of unique abilities to help you on your quest</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131340/extras/lelu_gif1.gif?t=1742243893\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles and navigate treacherous obstacles in an abandoned toy factory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131340/extras/lelu_gif3.gif?t=1742243893\" /> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3131340?t=1742243893","background